WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 3

01:42.090 --> 01:43.880
What does the temple worship?

01:43.980 --> 01:47.090
Any temple for worshipping is a divine temple.

01:47.370 --> 01:49.130
How could you not know that?

01:50.370 --> 01:51.810
Divine temple?

01:52.650 --> 01:55.280
When heaven was separated
from earth, giant monsters ran wild.

01:55.370 --> 01:57.630
Master from the divine temple
came to earth with dignity and virtue,

01:57.650 --> 01:58.980
teaching mankind characters and etiquette

01:58.980 --> 02:00.670
and helping mankind cutting mountains and making seas,

02:00.690 --> 02:02.680
thus laying foundation for the human race.

02:03.220 --> 02:05.170
Haven't you learned that from your parents?

02:07.930 --> 02:09.890
Mythology.

02:17.090 --> 02:18.970
You really don't know who I am?

02:19.010 --> 02:21.810
Anyway, don't step into the main hall.

03:17.180 --> 03:18.840
No ambushes.

03:21.290 --> 03:23.170
Is it really a coincidence?

03:26.570 --> 03:28.370
No statue of God as I expected.

03:39.850 --> 03:41.610
Mythology.

03:42.180 --> 03:46.890
For me, I never believe in God.

03:47.620 --> 03:48.850
Yet, I don't know

03:48.850 --> 03:50.470
how I came to the world.

03:50.490 --> 03:52.260
If there really is a divine temple,

03:52.260 --> 03:53.570
please do send down an envoy

03:53.570 --> 03:54.960
to explain to me.

03:54.980 --> 03:56.210
If you give me the answer,

03:56.210 --> 03:57.210
I will do you the favor of

03:57.210 --> 03:58.400
believing in you.

04:01.060 --> 04:03.200
Food and accommodation all covered.
Just think about it.

04:24.490 --> 04:25.920
My Lady!

04:27.420 --> 04:28.920
My Lady!

04:30.170 --> 04:31.090
Have you seen My Lady?

04:31.090 --> 04:32.570
No.

04:33.580 --> 04:37.600
My Lady! My Lady!

04:46.200 --> 04:48.750
=Lin Wan'er, daughter of Nanqing Prime Minister Lin Ruofu=

04:53.700 --> 04:55.370
I have a question for you.

04:57.490 --> 04:59.290
Are you an assassin?

05:01.020 --> 05:02.760
Not really.

05:03.740 --> 05:06.090
Then, are you sent by the God?

05:08.420 --> 05:10.760
Not really either.

05:11.020 --> 05:12.600
I think you are.

05:43.020 --> 05:45.920
Who... who are you?

05:51.580 --> 05:53.010
Are you OK?

05:53.490 --> 05:54.720
I'm fine.

05:54.820 --> 05:57.040
After vomiting several times, I just get used to it.

06:02.650 --> 06:05.440
My Lady! My Lady!

06:10.460 --> 06:11.920
Are you leaving?

06:14.370 --> 06:15.420
Are you with that man of importance

06:15.420 --> 06:16.760
in the main hall?

06:25.300 --> 06:26.440
Hand, please.

06:51.260 --> 06:52.970
I forgot to ask her name.

07:18.610 --> 07:20.140
My Lady, where have you been?

07:20.140 --> 07:21.760
I'm so worried.

07:44.050 --> 07:46.090
My Lady, are you OK?

07:48.330 --> 07:49.310
I'm fine.

07:49.330 --> 07:50.400
My Lady, how come you're smiling.

07:50.420 --> 07:52.030
You run about every time we come out.

07:52.050 --> 07:53.640
I'm so sacred.

07:54.370 --> 07:57.120
I'm certainly happy to come out.

07:57.140 --> 07:57.890
It's better than taking drugs everyday

07:57.890 --> 07:59.720
in my room.

07:59.740 --> 08:00.860
The imperial physician said

08:00.860 --> 08:03.850
sick as you are, you can't afford to catch a cold.

08:12.420 --> 08:15.290
My Lady, how come you cough blood again?

08:18.210 --> 08:19.370
I'm fine.

08:19.700 --> 08:21.120
I just

08:21.140 --> 08:22.690
get used to it.

08:22.980 --> 08:26.880
Oh no, you're confused.

08:58.730 --> 09:00.130
Rise and go!

09:33.780 --> 09:35.560
When did you get back?

09:35.580 --> 09:38.210
Young Master, I've waited for a long time.

09:40.730 --> 09:42.330
Follow that carriage!

09:49.100 --> 09:50.350
Where are you going?

09:50.370 --> 09:51.000
That way.

09:51.020 --> 09:52.080
Well.

09:52.100 --> 09:53.170
Young Master, aren't we going back the mansion?

09:53.170 --> 09:54.240
Who told you to go to the mansion?

09:54.260 --> 09:54.910
Follow that carriage!

09:54.930 --> 09:56.560
Make a turn.

09:56.580 --> 09:57.880
Make a turn!

09:57.900 --> 09:58.470
Over there!

09:58.490 --> 09:59.120
OK!

09:59.140 --> 10:00.920
Over there! That carriage!

10:05.100 --> 10:05.950
Make way!

10:05.970 --> 10:07.240
Make way! Make way! Make way!

10:07.260 --> 10:08.570
Make way!

10:12.700 --> 10:14.490
Guards, clear the street.

10:14.490 --> 10:15.720
Make way!

10:18.930 --> 10:21.010
Make way! Make way!

10:21.340 --> 10:22.840
Make way!

10:25.340 --> 10:26.610
Go away! Hurry up!

10:26.610 --> 10:28.010
Make way!

10:28.530 --> 10:30.510
Everyone! Hurry up!

10:30.530 --> 10:32.520
Make way! Everyone!

10:42.340 --> 10:45.450
Your Majesty, we can move forward now.

10:47.170 --> 10:48.480
Rise and go!

10:52.730 --> 10:55.000
Your Majesty, it's my fault

10:55.020 --> 10:57.440
the young man suddenly appeared

10:57.460 --> 10:59.050
during the worship ritual today.

10:59.050 --> 11:01.560
Your Majesty, I'm willing to take punishments.

11:01.580 --> 11:01.600
The worship ritual went on smoothly today.

11:01.600 --> 11:03.480
The worship ritual went on smoothly today.
=Gong Dian, Deputy Director of Imperial Guards of Nanqing=

11:03.480 --> 11:05.160
The worship ritual went on smoothly today.

11:05.460 --> 11:07.210
You've done well.

11:07.260 --> 11:09.440
Though today's worship ritual was not announced publicly,

11:09.460 --> 11:10.410
the temple was well-guarded

11:10.410 --> 11:12.460
by the imperial guards.

11:12.460 --> 11:14.370
Yet, the young man was able to

11:14.370 --> 11:15.640
pass various invisible sentries easily.

11:15.660 --> 11:18.040
I'm afraid something was wrong.

11:18.460 --> 11:19.590
I plead that

11:19.610 --> 11:22.000
the imperial guards be investigated thoroughly.

11:22.020 --> 11:23.960
You've hit him by palm.

11:24.020 --> 11:24.580
Yes.

11:24.580 --> 11:25.510
What do you think?

11:25.530 --> 11:28.270
Possessing profound internal strength at such a young age,

11:28.290 --> 11:29.960
he's kind of outstanding.

11:30.410 --> 11:31.260
Your Majesty!

11:31.260 --> 11:33.680
Considering what happened today,

11:33.700 --> 11:37.210
we'd better investigate the imperial guards.

11:38.050 --> 11:39.570
No need!

11:49.220 --> 11:50.690
Stop him!

12:10.610 --> 12:12.220
Ask him over.

12:12.220 --> 12:13.480
Yes!

12:14.100 --> 12:15.450
Let him pass!

12:24.340 --> 12:25.020
On the entrance road to the city,

12:25.020 --> 12:26.910
there were maidservants
from the imperial harem trying to stop the carriage.

12:26.930 --> 12:28.890
We've killed them all.

12:29.730 --> 12:31.250
I see.

12:50.100 --> 12:53.640
Some imperial guards came and left.

12:53.660 --> 12:54.680
What a pity!

12:54.700 --> 12:56.770
I can't hear their words clearly.

12:59.170 --> 13:00.810
My Lady.

13:01.780 --> 13:03.030
My Lady.

13:03.050 --> 13:04.220
You've been smiling

13:04.220 --> 13:05.460
after coming back from the Qing Temple.

13:05.460 --> 13:06.220
Have you found

13:06.220 --> 13:07.390
something interesting?

13:07.410 --> 13:08.470
Nothing special.

13:08.490 --> 13:09.460
I just met

13:09.460 --> 13:11.160
someone interesting.

13:11.900 --> 13:13.890
Others don't matter.

13:13.930 --> 13:15.000
I just hope that

13:15.020 --> 13:16.000
the Young Master of the Fan mansion

13:16.020 --> 13:17.800
is also an interesting person

13:17.820 --> 13:19.840
who can make you so happy.

13:24.580 --> 13:26.680
I know you don't want to marry him.

13:26.700 --> 13:30.390
But it's a marriage granted by His Majesty.

13:30.410 --> 13:31.770
I...

13:34.370 --> 13:35.720
Well...

13:41.340 --> 13:42.520
Your Majesty!

13:44.680 --> 13:47.190
=Emperor Qing, Nanqing's emperor=

13:48.290 --> 13:50.130
Who's that young man?

13:50.260 --> 13:53.100
He must be the bastard son of
Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue

13:53.100 --> 13:55.010
from Danzhou.

13:55.290 --> 13:58.370
He's called Fan Xian, I think.

13:58.730 --> 14:00.400
Tell me what you think.

14:00.610 --> 14:02.340
That young man suddenly appeared today.

14:02.340 --> 14:03.590
It was not an accident.

14:03.610 --> 14:04.810
It was...

14:05.370 --> 14:08.840
It was arranged by Your Majesty.

14:09.140 --> 14:10.880
Why should I arrange that?

14:10.900 --> 14:14.160
I dare not guess Your Majesty's intentions.

14:17.220 --> 14:18.520
Speak!

14:20.140 --> 14:21.330
It's...

14:22.410 --> 14:25.040
It's because Your Majesty wanted to see him.

14:26.020 --> 14:27.810
On the entrance road to the city,

14:28.140 --> 14:30.690
someone tried to ruin his reputation with maidservants.

14:30.930 --> 14:32.440
Who do you think that might be?

14:32.460 --> 14:34.810
I don't know.

14:35.050 --> 14:38.280
You don't know? Or you dare not tell?

14:44.490 --> 14:50.210
Judged from common sense, it might be the Crown Prince.

14:51.370 --> 14:52.650
The Crown Prince?

14:53.610 --> 14:55.760
By making such a guess,

14:55.780 --> 14:57.450
I've already born the rebellious sin.

14:57.660 --> 14:58.560
I just dare not keep silent

14:58.580 --> 14:59.880
to Your Majesty's question.

14:59.900 --> 15:02.370
Your Majesty, I'm willing to take punishments.

15:04.020 --> 15:06.520
Did Fan Xian kneel down

15:06.660 --> 15:08.160
in the side palace hall?

15:10.290 --> 15:11.880
I've paid attention.

15:11.900 --> 15:15.330
Fan Xian didn't kneel down in the Qing Temple.

15:17.170 --> 15:18.840
Refuse to kneel down before the God.

15:26.700 --> 15:28.650
It tastes bad.

15:29.410 --> 15:31.150
But don't forget to leave

15:31.170 --> 15:33.010
two taels of silver.

15:33.460 --> 15:34.600
Yes.

15:35.100 --> 15:35.950
Gong Dian.

15:35.970 --> 15:37.080
Yes, Your Majesty!

15:37.100 --> 15:40.040
I heard that the Crown Prince gave you a painting,

15:40.970 --> 15:42.690
and you like it very much.

15:46.970 --> 15:50.570
I acknowledge my sin!

15:52.900 --> 15:54.370
Let's go back to the Imperial Palace.

15:57.820 --> 16:00.880
It's natural for man to have hobbies.

16:00.900 --> 16:03.210
That's no sin.

16:03.290 --> 16:05.840
I see.

16:27.730 --> 16:29.280
Here we are, Young Master.

16:32.050 --> 16:34.570
Careful! Careful! Careful!

16:34.820 --> 16:37.280
The carriage will be returned to the back door.

16:37.780 --> 16:40.350
Young Master, please enter the mansion by yourself.

16:40.370 --> 16:43.400
Return? You're not from the Fan mansion?

17:05.410 --> 17:06.800
I am Fan Xian.

17:14.980 --> 17:16.530
I am Fan Xian.

17:18.980 --> 17:20.440
Young Master.

17:20.820 --> 17:22.390
This way, please.

17:22.410 --> 17:23.720
The side door?

17:24.410 --> 17:25.480
Is that my father's order?

17:25.500 --> 17:27.440
Master is still out in the Ministry of Revenue.

17:27.460 --> 17:29.410
This is ordered by Madam Liu Ruyu.

17:29.410 --> 17:30.010
If Liu Ruyu

17:30.010 --> 17:31.440
really wants to kill you,

17:31.460 --> 17:32.530
I'm afraid it won't be easy for you

17:32.530 --> 17:33.960
to enter the Fan mansion.

17:43.980 --> 17:47.370
Young Master, please come with me.

18:04.890 --> 18:06.960
Why aren't people talking in the yard?

18:06.980 --> 18:08.440
Madam Liu Ruyu is having an afternoon nap.

18:08.460 --> 18:09.720
Where's she napping?

18:09.740 --> 18:11.010
In the backyard.

18:11.380 --> 18:12.390
She's napping in the backyard,

18:12.410 --> 18:14.170
yet no one dares talk in the whole mansion!

18:15.010 --> 18:16.320
Is she tough?

18:16.340 --> 18:18.960
Young Master, please don't say that.

18:19.620 --> 18:21.800
Keep your voice down. Stop talking.

18:23.010 --> 18:24.960
She is certainly of means.

18:30.820 --> 18:31.900
Stop!

18:32.770 --> 18:33.990
Who's that?

18:34.010 --> 18:35.890
That's the private adviser of the mansion
who's in charge of bookkeeping.

18:36.050 --> 18:38.080
I can't hit you that far.

18:39.500 --> 18:40.930
Stand here.

18:41.050 --> 18:43.800
Keep running! Huh?

18:43.820 --> 18:44.840
Hide! Huh?

18:44.860 --> 18:46.370
Today, I'm gonna...

18:46.860 --> 18:47.630
You're a bookkeeping guy,

18:47.650 --> 18:49.290
but you runs faster than a rabbit.

18:51.860 --> 18:53.720
Catch your breath before chasing him again.

18:57.160 --> 18:59.710
=Fan Sizhe, second son of Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian=

19:02.770 --> 19:04.200
Why do you hold a drumstick?

19:06.250 --> 19:07.510
This is not a drumstick.

19:07.530 --> 19:08.720
It's a girl.

19:08.740 --> 19:10.050
Girl?

19:15.860 --> 19:17.200
Do you understand?

19:17.410 --> 19:18.960
Neither do I.

19:20.860 --> 19:21.630
What's this?

19:21.650 --> 19:22.800
I don't know.

19:22.820 --> 19:24.480
You don't know?

19:24.820 --> 19:25.980
Do you know who I am?

19:25.980 --> 19:26.680
Probably.

19:26.700 --> 19:27.440
All right.

19:27.460 --> 19:28.800
Then open it for me.

19:29.220 --> 19:30.960
Why not open it by yourself?

19:42.220 --> 19:44.840
Has Fan Xian arrived at the inner yard?

19:44.860 --> 19:46.680
Not yet, Madam.

19:46.700 --> 19:48.840
What takes him so long?

19:49.340 --> 19:51.980
Shall I go check out?

19:51.980 --> 19:55.720
No hurry. Let him take time.

19:56.320 --> 19:56.340
Liu Ruyu, Fan Xian's stepmother

19:56.340 --> 19:57.620
When he arrives at the inner yard,
=Liu Ruyu, Fan Xian's stepmother=

19:57.620 --> 19:58.360
let him wait inside the yard.
=Liu Ruyu, Fan Xian's stepmother=

19:58.360 --> 19:59.750
let him wait inside the yard.

19:59.770 --> 20:02.890
I'll see him after my nap.

20:02.980 --> 20:04.080
Yes.

20:04.100 --> 20:06.200
Come on! Try harder!

20:06.220 --> 20:07.840
Come on! Try harder!

20:07.860 --> 20:08.700
Almost open! Almost!

20:08.700 --> 20:10.080
Try harder! Try!

20:10.290 --> 20:11.530
Come on! Almost open!

20:11.530 --> 20:17.480
Come on! Come on! Come on!

20:17.500 --> 20:18.800
Open it for me!

20:18.860 --> 20:20.200
I can't open it, either.

20:20.220 --> 20:21.200
You know where this is?

20:21.220 --> 20:21.980
It's the Fan mansion.

20:21.980 --> 20:23.010
Everyone here

20:23.010 --> 20:23.700
respects me.

20:23.700 --> 20:24.380
Whatever I ask them to do,

20:24.380 --> 20:25.250
they'll do it.

20:25.250 --> 20:26.100
Now, I'm asking you

20:26.100 --> 20:27.320
to open the box for me.

20:27.340 --> 20:28.250
There's something wrong with your words.

20:28.250 --> 20:29.200
What's wrong?

20:29.220 --> 20:29.740
You just said that

20:29.740 --> 20:30.800
everyone here respects you.

20:30.820 --> 20:31.340
Right.

20:31.340 --> 20:31.700
You also said that

20:31.700 --> 20:32.650
they'll obey whatever you say.

20:32.650 --> 20:33.290
That's right.

20:33.290 --> 20:34.010
Then what if you ask them

20:34.010 --> 20:35.010
to beat you to death?

20:35.010 --> 20:35.740
If they do what you say,

20:35.740 --> 20:36.410
they'll have to hurt you,

20:36.410 --> 20:37.650
which means they don't respect you.

20:37.650 --> 20:38.580
If they don't beat you,

20:38.580 --> 20:39.580
then they are not at your command.

20:39.580 --> 20:40.820
See? You're self-contradictory.

20:40.820 --> 20:42.930
Only one of the two conditions can be satisfied.

20:43.220 --> 20:44.410
Let's go.

20:49.530 --> 20:51.410
That makes sense.

20:52.820 --> 20:54.250
Then what should I do?

20:54.290 --> 20:56.010
I have to let them beat me to death.

20:56.290 --> 20:58.050
They have to listen to me.

20:58.620 --> 20:59.620
That won't do!

20:59.620 --> 21:01.770
Whom will they follow after beating me to death?

21:02.580 --> 21:04.370
Then they can't beat me to death.

21:04.650 --> 21:05.290
But if they don't,

21:05.290 --> 21:07.600
it means they are not at my command.

21:10.930 --> 21:12.860
Is that my younger brother?

21:12.860 --> 21:14.150
Yes.

21:14.170 --> 21:15.840
Why did he chase the bookkeeping guy?

21:15.860 --> 21:17.360
Madam Liu Ruyu is taking a nap.

21:17.380 --> 21:19.480
He probably took the chance to ask for money.

21:19.500 --> 21:21.320
The bookkeeping guy runs so fast.

21:21.580 --> 21:22.650
Having been chased for years,

21:22.650 --> 21:24.460
he is quite a runner now.

21:24.460 --> 21:26.480
That kid has quite a temper.

21:26.500 --> 21:28.440
I dare not talk of him behind his back.

21:28.460 --> 21:29.410
Young Master Fan Xian,

21:29.410 --> 21:30.960
we've arrived at the inner yard.

21:30.980 --> 21:32.890
Where's Liu Ruyu?

21:33.820 --> 21:35.290
Where's Madam Liu Ruyu?

21:35.700 --> 21:37.290
Madam Liu Ruyu is napping inside.

21:37.290 --> 21:39.390
She asked you to wait.

21:39.410 --> 21:40.320
I'll wait inside.

21:40.340 --> 21:42.960
Young Master, that's not appropriate.

21:43.700 --> 21:45.050
Wait in the yard?

21:51.530 --> 21:53.720
Then I'll wait here.

21:58.340 --> 22:00.770
This yard is quite tranquil.

22:08.290 --> 22:12.080
Your Highness, I'm honored to see you.

22:12.930 --> 22:14.720
Haven't I told you before?

22:14.720 --> 22:14.740
Haven't I told you before?
=Li Chengqian, the Crown Prince of Nanqing=

22:14.740 --> 22:15.980
We both love calligraphy and painting,
=Li Chengqian, the Crown Prince of Nanqing=

22:15.980 --> 22:16.270
Li Chengqian, the Crown Prince of Nanqing

22:16.290 --> 22:17.560
and we share similar tastes and interests.

22:17.650 --> 22:18.560
We are friends.

22:18.580 --> 22:21.130
No need to be too polite.

22:24.580 --> 22:26.600
These calligraphy works and paintings

22:26.620 --> 22:30.130
are the most precious ones

22:30.250 --> 22:32.370
I've collected over the years.

22:57.380 --> 22:59.650
The rest of my collection

23:00.930 --> 23:03.560
have been burnt to ashes.

23:03.700 --> 23:05.080
From today on,

23:05.700 --> 23:09.720
I have no hobbies.

23:17.770 --> 23:20.650
This is the famous painting from the former dynasty

23:20.700 --> 23:22.320
bestowed to me by Your Highness.

23:22.340 --> 23:24.560
I beg Your Highness take it back.

23:27.010 --> 23:30.110
Gong Dian, you don't have to do this.

23:30.130 --> 23:32.200
Today, His Majesty said that

23:32.530 --> 23:36.410
it's natural for man to have hobbies.

23:36.460 --> 23:39.770
Your Highness, from today on,

23:39.820 --> 23:44.960
I have no hobbies.

23:45.580 --> 23:47.390
What on earth happened?

23:47.410 --> 23:52.050
His Majesty went to the Qing Temple
for a worship ritual today.

23:54.050 --> 23:56.200
Why wasn't the Board of Rites informed?

23:56.620 --> 23:58.560
It was an incognito trip.

23:58.860 --> 24:00.170
Later

24:00.650 --> 24:02.390
in the Qing Temple,

24:02.410 --> 24:04.200
His Majesty met a young man.

24:05.050 --> 24:07.650
His name is Fan Xian.

24:13.010 --> 24:14.320
Then what?

24:17.100 --> 24:18.870
He's outside?

24:18.890 --> 24:20.360
Yes, Madam.

24:20.380 --> 24:21.650
He's standing there.

24:21.700 --> 24:24.290
Anxious or angry?

24:24.290 --> 24:25.600
Neither.

24:25.860 --> 24:27.080
He said

24:27.250 --> 24:29.130
he also wanted to nap for a while.

24:31.130 --> 24:33.320
Haven't I told you to keep him in the yard?

24:38.530 --> 24:39.340
Wait a minute!

24:39.340 --> 24:41.320
Why does he hold a drumstick?

24:41.340 --> 24:42.360
I've no idea.

24:42.380 --> 24:44.150
He's been holding it all the way
since he entered the mansion.

24:44.170 --> 24:46.010
And he doesn't take a bite.

24:46.460 --> 24:48.170
Will it be a custom of Danzhou?

24:48.500 --> 24:49.510
Forget it!

24:49.530 --> 24:51.230
Who gave him the chair?

24:51.250 --> 24:53.360
He grabbed it himself.

24:53.380 --> 24:55.370
This young man from Danzhou

24:55.500 --> 24:57.680
might not be easy to handle.

24:58.860 --> 25:00.600
Then let's see him.

25:28.530 --> 25:30.410
You must be Xian'er.

25:31.500 --> 25:33.480
You must be tired after such a long way.

25:33.500 --> 25:36.230
I did take a nap just now.

25:36.250 --> 25:37.840
I don't mean to snub you.

25:37.860 --> 25:38.960
That's fine. That's fine.

25:38.980 --> 25:40.390
If you don't wake me up,

25:40.410 --> 25:42.170
I might still be sleeping.

25:43.860 --> 25:45.410
Madam, have a seat.

25:46.530 --> 25:48.480
The people in Danzhou are simple and honest.

25:48.500 --> 25:49.480
Now look at you.

25:49.500 --> 25:51.910
You're really raised well.

25:51.930 --> 25:55.080
Though you lack certain grace,

25:55.100 --> 25:58.080
you do seem naïve and natural.

25:58.100 --> 25:59.600
Naïve and natural.

25:59.620 --> 26:00.740
She suggests that I'm like a wild monkey!

26:00.740 --> 26:02.320
Madam, you really flatter me.

26:02.340 --> 26:03.480
Desolated as Danzhou is,

26:03.500 --> 26:05.360
I've never met someone like you.

26:05.380 --> 26:07.480
So elegant! So refined!

26:07.500 --> 26:08.750
If I didn't know in advance,

26:08.770 --> 26:11.250
I'm sure to mistake you as the principle wife of my father.

26:11.930 --> 26:13.170
The little bastard is suggesting

26:13.170 --> 26:15.440
I'm only a concubine.

26:16.700 --> 26:19.130
Where's the man with a box?

26:20.130 --> 26:20.960
Well.

26:20.980 --> 26:22.480
I came out so hurriedly

26:22.500 --> 26:24.110
that I forgot to take my reception gift

26:24.130 --> 26:25.270
for you.

26:25.290 --> 26:26.650
Wait a minute.

26:31.890 --> 26:33.320
Where is he?

26:33.770 --> 26:35.960
I've seen you. Stay where you are.

26:36.980 --> 26:39.130
I'll beat you to death when I get over.

26:41.820 --> 26:43.030
I've figured it out.

26:43.050 --> 26:43.580
Why should I

26:43.580 --> 26:44.990
beat myself to death?

26:45.010 --> 26:46.650
How should I know?

26:46.890 --> 26:48.720
Are you playing me?

26:48.740 --> 26:49.960
What do you think?

26:54.170 --> 26:57.840
Madam, Young Master didn't get the money,

26:58.100 --> 27:00.010
so he's really irritable now.

27:00.010 --> 27:03.410
I'm afraid he'll go violent.

27:04.100 --> 27:05.480
I know.

27:05.500 --> 27:07.720
Why else do I excuse myself?

27:07.770 --> 27:08.990
If I'm there,

27:09.010 --> 27:11.320
he will be restrained.

27:11.340 --> 27:12.440
What if Young Master

27:12.460 --> 27:14.510
really beats up Fan Xian?

27:14.530 --> 27:16.320
My son is legitimate.

27:16.340 --> 27:18.080
Fan Xian is just a bastard.

27:18.100 --> 27:20.050
They're radically different.

27:20.050 --> 27:21.720
If Fan Xian is beaten up

27:21.740 --> 27:23.200
the first day he enters our mansion,

27:23.220 --> 27:25.480
he will be looked down upon ever since.

27:25.500 --> 27:26.630
But Madam,

27:26.650 --> 27:29.080
I heard that Fan Xian can practice martial arts.

27:29.100 --> 27:30.230
What if

27:30.250 --> 27:30.860
he beats Young Master up

27:30.860 --> 27:32.390
instead?

27:32.410 --> 27:33.990
Just let him.

27:34.010 --> 27:36.030
Beating up the legitimate son upon arrival at our mansion,

27:36.050 --> 27:38.820
and being ferocious and mischievous
without due respect for the hierarchy,

27:38.820 --> 27:41.560
how can my husband keep him?

27:44.130 --> 27:44.890
Don't you think

27:44.890 --> 27:46.800
you're a bit out of line?

27:47.010 --> 27:48.870
I'm still standing.

27:48.890 --> 27:50.440
How come you are seated?

27:51.890 --> 27:53.130
Stand up!

27:57.250 --> 27:58.840
Give me your hand!

28:00.130 --> 28:01.410
Where's everyone?

28:01.410 --> 28:03.080
How did you enter the inner yard?

28:03.100 --> 28:03.990
Who the hell are you?

28:04.010 --> 28:05.200
Fan Xian.

28:06.860 --> 28:08.080
Fan Xian.

28:08.100 --> 28:08.980
You're that bastard son

28:08.980 --> 28:11.110
from Danzhou?

28:11.130 --> 28:12.390
I actually thought you're somebody!

28:12.410 --> 28:13.770
Considering your status,

28:13.770 --> 28:15.560
how dare you trick me?

28:15.740 --> 28:16.510
Give me you hand!

28:16.530 --> 28:18.200
What's wrong with my status?

28:18.220 --> 28:19.980
I'm your elder brother.

28:19.980 --> 28:20.930
Elder brother is like father.

28:20.930 --> 28:21.700
In that sense,

28:21.700 --> 28:23.390
I'm your father.

28:23.410 --> 28:25.080
I'm so pissed! I...

28:25.100 --> 28:26.410
Stop!

28:42.580 --> 28:43.890
Ruoruo!

28:44.560 --> 28:45.890
=Fan Ruoruo, daughter of Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian=

28:45.890 --> 28:46.240
Brother!
=Fan Ruoruo, daughter of Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian=

28:46.240 --> 28:47.320
Brother!

28:48.410 --> 28:50.720
I told you I would come.

28:52.460 --> 28:54.680
You're always my elder brother.

28:55.700 --> 28:57.010
Always!

28:58.650 --> 29:00.840
Will you come to the capital city again?

29:02.410 --> 29:06.410
One day, I will.

29:14.700 --> 29:15.960
Kneel down!

29:22.410 --> 29:25.800
I just met the bookkeeping guy.

29:26.410 --> 29:28.250
You tried to bully him again!

29:28.860 --> 29:31.360
He... he ran so fast.

29:31.380 --> 29:33.560
How could I catch him?

29:33.580 --> 29:35.150
Aren't you supposed to

29:35.170 --> 29:37.410
be studying now?

29:41.460 --> 29:44.200
I can pardon you for all these!

29:44.820 --> 29:45.750
Really?

29:45.770 --> 29:47.200
Kneel back!

29:55.130 --> 29:56.410
Give it to me.

29:57.650 --> 30:00.170
Sister, you just said you could pardon me!

30:00.650 --> 30:01.960
Give it to me!

30:05.380 --> 30:06.800
Now I punish you

30:06.980 --> 30:09.200
for being rude to our elder brother.

30:10.250 --> 30:12.560
-He's just a bastard! -Open your hand!

30:13.530 --> 30:15.650
Sister, you actually beat me for a stranger!

30:15.650 --> 30:16.930
Fan Sizhe!

30:22.650 --> 30:23.930
The other hand!

30:31.340 --> 30:33.380
Never call our elder brother by his name!

30:33.380 --> 30:34.910
Nor can you show disrespect!

30:34.930 --> 30:37.440
If it ever happens again, I'll punish you again!

30:38.380 --> 30:39.560
Do you remember?

30:41.530 --> 30:42.800
Get up!

30:57.010 --> 30:58.530
Grown up as he is,

30:58.650 --> 31:00.720
he turns to mom for help all the time.

31:00.740 --> 31:05.200
Mom! Mom!

31:07.340 --> 31:09.080
Brother, how's your trip?

31:09.100 --> 31:10.530
Come over to my room.

31:12.130 --> 31:13.560
Who came up with the name

31:13.580 --> 31:14.890
Fan Sizhe?
(Same pronunciation with Versace in Chinese)

31:15.050 --> 31:16.890
Father did! What's wrong?

31:18.250 --> 31:19.800
Really nice!

31:21.410 --> 31:22.930
I'm glad he beat you!

31:25.860 --> 31:27.990
I was... Stop drinking!

31:28.010 --> 31:30.030
I was beaten!

31:30.050 --> 31:31.460
When your father come back,

31:31.460 --> 31:32.580
tell him that

31:32.580 --> 31:33.960
you were beaten.

31:33.980 --> 31:35.870
It's useless to tell him.

31:35.890 --> 31:38.560
Dad is the one who asks my elder sister to discipline me!

31:39.620 --> 31:40.500
Ruoruo is the one who beat you?

31:40.500 --> 31:42.530
Yes! Who dare beat me

31:42.530 --> 31:44.170
but her?

31:44.460 --> 31:45.340
Haven't I sent her away

31:45.340 --> 31:46.800
from home?

31:46.930 --> 31:47.860
How come she's back?

31:47.860 --> 31:49.530
How can I know?

31:50.050 --> 31:51.840
I don't care.

31:51.860 --> 31:53.800
Anyway, my hand aches now.

31:54.930 --> 31:56.800
What can I do to ease you pain?

31:56.890 --> 31:58.320
It'll be fine

31:58.340 --> 32:00.050
with money on it.

32:00.650 --> 32:01.460
Look at you!

32:01.460 --> 32:02.130
How can you beat that fox

32:02.130 --> 32:03.720
from Danzhou?

32:03.890 --> 32:06.080
I can beat him if I have money.

32:06.100 --> 32:07.440
You!

32:26.820 --> 32:28.290
The handwriting of Zhuang Mohan,

32:28.290 --> 32:30.130
a famous writer from Beiqi.

32:30.980 --> 32:32.410
You like his handwriting?

32:32.580 --> 32:33.930
It's a gift from others.

32:41.890 --> 32:43.410
The sword once used by Si Gujian,

32:43.410 --> 32:44.870
a great master from Dongyi Town.

32:44.890 --> 32:46.270
The sword of a great master?

32:46.290 --> 32:47.650
Really?

32:47.820 --> 32:49.890
I don't know. It's also a gift.

32:50.820 --> 32:52.720
Those jades and antiques

32:52.740 --> 32:54.170
are all gifts.

32:54.620 --> 32:55.870
Lend me a box.

32:55.890 --> 32:58.130
Take the wooden one in the middle.

33:02.700 --> 33:05.560
Who gave you all these gifts?

33:05.700 --> 33:07.960
Just young ladies from eminent families.

33:07.980 --> 33:09.170
Why?

33:09.530 --> 33:11.250
Asking for updates.

33:12.050 --> 33:13.410
What?

33:13.620 --> 33:15.030
The letters you wrote to me

33:15.050 --> 33:16.500
contain many chapters of

33:16.500 --> 33:17.820
the Red Mansions.

33:17.820 --> 33:18.460
The young ladies

33:18.460 --> 33:19.910
who visited me occasionally saw it

33:19.930 --> 33:21.080
and found it marvelous.

33:21.100 --> 33:22.510
Words spread so fast.

33:22.530 --> 33:24.170
Now all the unmarried young ladies

33:24.170 --> 33:25.600
in the capital city

33:25.620 --> 33:27.110
are fans of your book.

33:27.130 --> 33:28.700
They give me gifts every day

33:28.700 --> 33:30.600
for updates.

33:30.620 --> 33:32.230
Where did you learn

33:32.250 --> 33:33.890
the word "update"?

33:34.100 --> 33:35.410
From your letters.

33:35.410 --> 33:37.200
I just borrowed it.

33:39.010 --> 33:39.840
They don't know

33:39.860 --> 33:41.320
who wrote the book, right?

33:42.380 --> 33:43.600
Do be relieved.

33:43.650 --> 33:45.530
They've no idea that you wrote it.

33:46.170 --> 33:47.800
I've told you so many times.

33:47.820 --> 33:48.890
I really didn't write it!

33:48.890 --> 33:50.890
It was written by a Mr. Cao.

33:50.980 --> 33:53.650
Brother, no need to hide from me.

33:53.650 --> 33:55.130
I've written to grandma.

33:55.130 --> 33:56.100
She said

33:56.100 --> 33:57.380
there's no Mr. Cao

33:57.380 --> 33:58.800
in Danzhou.

33:58.820 --> 34:00.150
I know

34:00.170 --> 34:01.720
you're afraid that popularity

34:01.740 --> 34:03.200
might cause jealousy.

34:03.620 --> 34:04.440
Rest assured!

34:04.460 --> 34:06.560
Your secret is safe with me!

34:06.580 --> 34:08.080
No one will know

34:08.140 --> 34:09.510
you're the greatest literary giant

34:09.530 --> 34:12.650
in the world.

34:12.820 --> 34:14.690
I'd better drink some tea.

34:19.690 --> 34:23.120
That's what happened today.

34:23.140 --> 34:25.320
His Majesty didn't speak to Fan Xian?

34:25.340 --> 34:26.400
No.

34:26.420 --> 34:28.710
And he killed all the maidservants
who tried to stop the carriage?

34:28.730 --> 34:29.620
Exactly.

34:29.620 --> 34:30.770
That's why you're here

34:30.770 --> 34:32.030
ripping paintings?

34:32.050 --> 34:33.690
From today on,

34:35.580 --> 34:37.490
I won't have personal relationship

34:39.660 --> 34:42.240
with Your Highness any more.

34:43.730 --> 34:46.240
I have to say something

34:47.210 --> 34:49.240
from my heart.

34:50.290 --> 34:52.280
Your Highness, I beg your pardon!

34:53.250 --> 34:54.370
Go ahead!

34:54.900 --> 34:56.560
Your Highness, you're the
Crown Prince of the Eastern Palace.

34:56.580 --> 34:57.970
It's understandable that

34:57.970 --> 34:59.290
you have to associate with civil and military officials.

34:59.290 --> 35:01.180
But I'm in charge of the imperial palace

35:01.180 --> 35:03.360
and I have to guard beside His Majesty.

35:03.380 --> 35:04.800
If I develop a deep

35:05.210 --> 35:08.240
personal relationship with you,

35:08.730 --> 35:14.840
can His Majesty feel relieved?

35:16.620 --> 35:17.970
Go on!

35:18.100 --> 35:20.800
Fan Xian from Danzhou is of low birth.

35:20.820 --> 35:22.370
His Majesty didn't go out secretly

35:22.770 --> 35:25.000
to see him.

35:25.450 --> 35:27.170
Today, His Majesty

35:27.210 --> 35:29.240
also said the following words.

35:29.490 --> 35:32.890
The worship ritual went on smoothly today.

35:33.100 --> 35:34.930
You've done well.

35:36.100 --> 35:38.450
I didn't realize what he meant at that time.

35:38.690 --> 35:42.170
Later after careful consideration, I felt so frightened.

35:44.050 --> 35:45.580
His Majesty knew that

35:45.580 --> 35:47.800
I was deeply associated with Your Highness.

35:48.010 --> 35:49.180
Yet, he put me

35:49.180 --> 35:50.940
in charge of safety

35:50.940 --> 35:52.750
for this secret trip out.

35:52.770 --> 35:54.650
He certainly didn't come out

35:55.100 --> 35:56.880
to see Fan Xian,

35:56.900 --> 35:58.450
but to see

35:59.660 --> 36:00.730
whether I'll stop Fan Xian

36:00.730 --> 36:02.410
or not.

36:03.100 --> 36:05.190
As an imperial guard,

36:05.210 --> 36:06.840
I take orders directly from His Majesty.

36:06.860 --> 36:08.730
My duty

36:08.940 --> 36:10.290
requires me to associate with

36:10.290 --> 36:11.970
no officials.

36:12.100 --> 36:14.120
As an official,

36:14.140 --> 36:16.930
I should be diligent in my work

36:17.100 --> 36:18.890
and introspect myself often.

36:35.010 --> 36:37.230
It's not easy for you to give such sincere advice.

36:37.250 --> 36:39.640
Others might not dare to

36:39.660 --> 36:41.690
say those words.

36:42.380 --> 36:46.280
I've committed a deadly sin.

36:50.860 --> 36:53.170
What happened to Fan Xian today

36:53.290 --> 36:55.240
was not my planning.

36:58.140 --> 36:59.890
Fine! Fine!

37:00.580 --> 37:01.840
As for this painting,

37:01.860 --> 37:03.320
I'll take it back.

37:11.690 --> 37:13.730
From now on,

37:13.940 --> 37:16.170
we should carry out our own duties.

37:16.290 --> 37:18.650
No need to meet in private.

37:19.450 --> 37:21.320
Your Highness, thanks for your understanding.

37:21.530 --> 37:25.560
I'll excuse myself.

37:41.420 --> 37:44.490
It reads the date of your return.

37:45.660 --> 37:47.030
Who gave it to you?

37:47.050 --> 37:48.080
I don't know.

37:48.100 --> 37:49.990
It appeared on my desk last night.

37:50.010 --> 37:50.690
So today,

37:50.690 --> 37:52.080
I rushed back specially

37:52.100 --> 37:54.400
for fear that Fan Sizhe might offend you.

37:54.420 --> 37:56.130
He's really scared of you.

37:56.180 --> 37:57.270
He's very mischievous.

37:57.290 --> 37:59.360
Father always asks me to restrain him.

37:59.380 --> 38:00.580
He's scared of me

38:00.580 --> 38:01.710
from the bottom of his heart

38:01.730 --> 38:03.240
since childhood.

38:03.660 --> 38:04.800
His mother let you do that?

38:04.820 --> 38:07.730
Normally, Liu Ruyu dares not mess up with me.

38:08.050 --> 38:09.800
Really tough!

38:11.340 --> 38:12.750
Have you figured it out?

38:12.770 --> 38:14.670
How come Fan Ruoruo is back?

38:14.690 --> 38:16.490
We specially calculated the date

38:16.490 --> 38:17.710
to send her away.

38:17.730 --> 38:18.880
I've asked them.

38:18.900 --> 38:20.450
They said Lady Ruoruo

38:20.450 --> 38:21.430
got rid of them

38:21.450 --> 38:22.600
not long after leaving home,

38:22.620 --> 38:24.230
and she went back on her own.

38:24.250 --> 38:24.940
It seems that

38:24.940 --> 38:25.880
she's long known

38:25.900 --> 38:28.930
the accurate arrival time of Fan Xian.

38:28.970 --> 38:30.140
Who told her?

38:30.140 --> 38:33.600
I've checked everyone, but no one has ever told her.

38:33.620 --> 38:35.560
Then how could she know?

38:35.660 --> 38:36.890
Mom!

38:37.490 --> 38:39.690
When can I leave?

38:40.770 --> 38:41.820
Fan Ruoruo alone

38:41.820 --> 38:43.600
is already hard to deal with.

38:43.620 --> 38:45.820
It appears that Fan Xian is also cunning.

38:45.820 --> 38:47.690
Can't you focus here?

38:47.820 --> 38:50.510
There's nothing to be focused on!

38:50.530 --> 38:51.250
He's just

38:51.250 --> 38:53.880
a bastard son from Danzhou.

38:53.900 --> 38:54.450
If he behaves improperly,

38:54.450 --> 38:56.320
a good beating will do him good.

38:57.290 --> 38:58.800
We can't beat him at home.

38:58.820 --> 38:59.920
Well,

38:59.940 --> 39:02.230
I'll ask him out for lunch tomorrow.

39:02.250 --> 39:04.100
Then I'll beat him up on the street.

39:04.100 --> 39:05.520
How do you like that?

39:05.900 --> 39:07.490
Breaking tricks with pure force.

39:07.490 --> 39:09.370
That's sort of a plan.

39:10.210 --> 39:11.600
Mom!

39:12.140 --> 39:13.840
To trick him out for lunch,

39:13.860 --> 39:16.240
I'll need money for support.

39:16.340 --> 39:17.890
Support! Support!

39:22.180 --> 39:24.370
Fan Ruoruo...

39:25.010 --> 39:27.230
When I was young, she beat about the bush

39:27.250 --> 39:29.230
and tried to suppress me with schemes.

39:29.250 --> 39:30.100
Luckily, you wrote to me

39:30.100 --> 39:31.730
and taught me how to deal with her.

39:31.940 --> 39:33.230
Over these years,

39:33.250 --> 39:34.560
she know that I'm shrewd and deep,

39:34.580 --> 39:36.520
so she stops picking fights with me.

39:36.730 --> 39:38.210
However,

39:38.290 --> 39:40.690
I can't figure out

39:41.180 --> 39:43.080
who's been helping me secretly.

39:43.100 --> 39:44.100
Uncle Wuzhu must have arrived in the capital city

39:44.100 --> 39:45.510
earlier than me.

39:45.530 --> 39:46.840
Who's Uncle Wuzhu?

39:46.860 --> 39:48.430
The one who taught me to climb cliffs.

39:48.450 --> 39:49.050
His name

39:49.050 --> 39:50.230
must be kept from others.

39:50.250 --> 39:51.930
So I didn't mention him in the letters.

39:53.140 --> 39:54.640
Then why do you tell me.

39:54.660 --> 39:56.970
You're my younger sister. You're no others.

39:57.940 --> 40:00.690
Is that Uncle Wuzhu trustworthy?

40:01.100 --> 40:04.240
As to him, it's a long story.

40:04.690 --> 40:06.950
My Lady, Master's back.

40:06.970 --> 40:09.280
He asks Young Master Fan Xian to see him in his study.

40:10.100 --> 40:11.270
Keep this for me for a while.

40:11.290 --> 40:12.430
I was wondering

40:12.450 --> 40:13.690
what's the drumstick about.

40:13.690 --> 40:15.080
I'll tell you everything later.

40:24.450 --> 40:27.160
Master wants to see Fan Xian right when he's back?

40:27.180 --> 40:28.640
Yes, Madam.

40:28.660 --> 40:31.000
It's no big deal.

40:32.940 --> 40:34.560
Keep watching.

40:34.580 --> 40:35.970
Yes.

40:38.180 --> 40:39.530
Your father's attitude to Fan Xian

40:39.530 --> 40:40.530
is of key importance.

40:40.530 --> 40:41.670
Mom!

40:41.690 --> 40:43.840
What attitude?

40:43.860 --> 40:44.940
He left Fan Xian in Danzhou

40:44.940 --> 40:45.820
for so many years.

40:45.820 --> 40:47.640
Did he ever go back to visit him?

40:47.660 --> 40:49.800
That's the weirdest part.

40:50.380 --> 40:53.030
Your father is not a cold man.

40:53.050 --> 40:54.340
If he visited Fan Xian

40:54.340 --> 40:55.710
in Danzhou occasionally,

40:55.730 --> 40:57.190
I wouldn't be so nervous.

40:57.210 --> 40:58.230
But he just left him there

40:58.250 --> 40:59.530
and ignored him.

40:59.530 --> 41:01.730
It doesn't make sense.

41:02.010 --> 41:03.050
So I sent someone

41:03.050 --> 41:04.840
to watch Fan Xian in Danzhou.

41:04.860 --> 41:07.990
I just want to know

41:08.010 --> 41:09.710
whether he contacted Fan Xian secretly or not.

41:09.730 --> 41:10.530
I find it weird

41:10.530 --> 41:12.760
all the time.

41:19.970 --> 41:21.010
I can't protect you

41:21.010 --> 41:22.800
for a lifetime.

41:22.820 --> 41:25.080
You have to rely on yourself eventually.

41:25.340 --> 41:27.920
As to your future, I...

41:27.940 --> 41:30.320
Money! How much will you give me?

41:30.580 --> 41:32.000
Not a dime!

41:34.210 --> 41:36.520
No money! Then I can't beat him.

41:36.770 --> 41:38.370
I can't! I can't!

41:45.450 --> 41:47.380
Master said you could go in

41:47.380 --> 41:49.280
without reporting.

42:50.520 --> 42:54.100
In the river of history,

42:54.120 --> 42:57.590
time goes round and round.

43:00.400 --> 43:03.740
Memories about the former and present lives

43:03.760 --> 43:07.830
join each other in an endless way.

43:09.720 --> 43:12.340
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:12.360 --> 43:14.600
one season follows another in a flash,

43:14.600 --> 43:17.100
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:17.120 --> 43:18.720
I just can't give up

43:18.720 --> 43:22.060
to be with you for my whole life.

43:22.080 --> 43:27.550
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:28.800 --> 43:31.350
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:31.640 --> 43:33.680
Year after year in the wandering,

43:33.680 --> 43:36.340
I count the remaining years.

43:36.360 --> 43:38.540
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:38.560 --> 43:40.550
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:40.840 --> 43:43.230
I never feel regretful.

43:43.280 --> 43:44.640
In such a chaotic world,

43:44.640 --> 43:47.620
I still miss you as ever.

43:47.640 --> 43:50.590
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:50.880 --> 43:52.940
With a gentle heart,

43:52.960 --> 43:55.620
I cherish our remaining years.

43:55.640 --> 43:57.160
Even though we have to go through

43:57.160 --> 43:59.670
all the hardships along the journey,

43:59.800 --> 44:06.990
you always stay by my side,

44:07.080 --> 44:09.750
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:10.040 --> 44:12.120
Year after year in the wandering,

44:12.120 --> 44:14.780
I count the remaining years.

44:14.800 --> 44:16.940
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:16.960 --> 44:19.190
even though we end up the destiny,

44:19.400 --> 44:21.580
I never feel regretful.

44:21.600 --> 44:23.000
In such a chaotic world,

44:23.000 --> 44:26.060
I still miss you as ever.

44:26.080 --> 44:29.190
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:29.280 --> 44:31.420
With a gentle heart,

44:31.440 --> 44:34.140
I cherish our remaining years.

44:34.160 --> 44:35.600
Even though we have to go through

44:35.600 --> 44:38.260
all the hardships along the journey,

44:38.280 --> 44:47.040
you always stay by my side...
